  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper evaluates a 10‑qubit variational quantum circuit learning (QCL) model for cross‑sectional stock return prediction on the TOPIX500 dataset (2008–2021). In backtesting, QCL achieved 1.35% annualized excess return with 6.18% tracking error (information ratio 0.22), underperforming classical neural networks (IR up to 0.41) and a tensor‑network model (IR 0.69). Experiments were performed on a noiseless Qulacs simulator with a depth‑3 ansatz and 90 trainable parameters.",
